  "content_id": "16136054",
  "title": "How do I contact the team?",
  "description": "The Edge support team can be reached by visiting our website https://edge.app/support/ which will give access to our articles, support tic...",
  "body": "<p class=\"no-margin\">The Edge support team can be reached by visiting our website <a href=\"https://edge.app/support/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"intercom-content-link\">https://edge.app/support/</a> which will give access to our articles, support tickets, and chat.</p><p class=\"no-margin\">You can also open Edge and tap Help for options to reach our support team such as submit a ticket, call, etc.</p><p class=\"no-margin\">If for any reason you do not have access to the app you are always welcome to contact</p><p class=\"no-margin\">By sending an email to <a href=\"mailto:support@edge.app\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"intercom-content-link\">support@edge.app</a>, or by calling <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"intercom-content-link\">1-619-777-5688</a></p><p class=\"no-margin\">For partnership and business inquiries please reach out to <a href=\"mailto:marketing@edge.app\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"intercom-content-link\">marketing@edge.app</a>.</p>",
  "author_id": 9849332,
  "state": "published",
